Managed by Ansible (teamcraft-deploy, role glitchtip).

GlitchTip runs here on its own (group teamcraft_crash_reports), behind the web server already on this
host. It forwards https://{{ glitchtip_hostname }} to http://{{ teamcraft_upstream_host }}:{{ teamcraft_ports.glitchtip }}.

  plesk-apache-https.conf  Plesk, Apache only: "Additional directives for HTTPS" of the domain
  plesk-nginx.conf         Plesk, nginx in front: "Additional nginx directives"
  apache.conf              plain Apache 2.4: a virtual host
  nginx.conf               plain nginx: a server block

The proxy must: terminate TLS for {{ glitchtip_hostname }}, pass Host unchanged, set X-Forwarded-For and
X-Forwarded-Proto, accept request bodies up to 100 MB. Guide: docs/components/glitchtip.md in
teamcraft-deploy.
